# Bandit's Haul: "Whenever you commit a crime, put a loot counter on this artifact. This ability triggers only once each turn."
# On turn 1 Bot1 casts it with a Black Lotus, then bolts Bot2 twice (Mox Rubies): each is a crime (CR 700.13) but there is one loot
# counter. On turn 3 a Bolt at Bot1 itself is no crime (the Haul's own "{T}: Add one mana of any color" pays for it; still one
# counter); a Bolt at Bot2 on that same turn is a crime on a new turn, so the second counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Bandit's Haul
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

